#: componentPage.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid "&Setup %1"
msgstr "%1 &instellen"

#: componentPage.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgid "&Preview %1"
msgstr "%1-&Vöransicht"

#: componentPage.cpp:90
msgid ""
"Selecting the Setup or Preview option may cause the panel and/or the desktop "
"to be temporarily shut down. To prevent data loss please make sure you are "
"not actively using these components."
msgstr ""
"Söchst Du de Optschoon \"Instellen\" oder \"Vöransicht\" ut, warrt dat "
"Paneel un/oder de Schriefdisch villicht för en Stoot utmaakt. Bruuk bitte "
"keen vun ehr Komponenten, anners kaamt Di villicht Daten weg."

#: componentPage.cpp:92 userManagement.cpp:84
msgid "Attention"
msgstr "Wohrschoen"

#: componentPage.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid "Setup %1"
msgstr "%1 instellen"

#: componentPage.cpp:133
msgid "<qt>There was an unexpected problem with the runtime environment.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Dat geev en nich verwacht Problem mit de Looptiet-Ümgeven.</qt>"

#: componentPage.cpp:164
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>You can now configure %1. When you are finished click <b>Save</b> to "
"make the new configuration permanent."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Du kannst %1 nu instellen. Büst Du dor mit dör, klick op <b>Sekern</b>, "
"denn warrt de niege Instellen duerhaftig wohrt."

#: componentPage.cpp:166
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 Setup"
msgstr "%1 instellen"

#: componentPage.cpp:273
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>This is how %1 will behave and look with the new settings. Any changes "
"you now make to the settings will not be saved.<p>Click <b>Ok</b> to return "
"to your own personal %2 configuration."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Sodennig süht %1 mit de niegen Instellen ut un beert sik. Nix, wat Du nu "
"an de Instellen maakst, warrt sekert.<p>Klick op <b>OK</b>, wenn Du retuur "
"na Dien egen persöönliche %2-Instellen wullt."

#: componentPage.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid "%1 Preview"
msgstr "%1-Vöransicht"

#: kioskConfigDialog.cpp:40
msgid "Configure Kiosk Admin Tool"
msgstr "Pleegwarktüüch \"Kiosk\" instellen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:1
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allmeen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:2
msgid "Generic restrictions"
msgstr "Allgemeen Ingrenzen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:3
msgid "Disable Window Manager context menu (Alt-F3)"
msgstr "Finsterpleger-Rechtsklickmenü utmaken (Alt+F3)"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:4
msgid ""
"The Window Manager context menu is normally shown when Alt-F3 is pressed or "
"when the menu button on the window frame is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Den Finsterpleger sien Rechtsklickmenü warrt normalerwies wiest, wenn Du Alt"
"+F3 drückst oder op den Finsterrahmen sien Menüknoop klickst."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:5 kiosk_data.cpp:173
msgid "Disable Bookmarks"
msgstr "Leestekens utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:6
msgid "Disable Bookmarks in all applications."
msgstr "Leestekens binnen all Programmen utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:7 kiosk_data.cpp:55
msgid "Disable all tasks and applications that require root access"
msgstr "All Opgaven un Programmen utmaken, de Systeemplegerverlöven bruukt"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:8
msgid ""
"In multi-user environments the users normally do not know the root password; "
"in such a case, it may be desirable to use this option to remove the tasks "
"and applications from the menus that the users cannot use."
msgstr ""
"In Mehrbruker-Ümgeven weet de Brukers dat Systeempleger-Passwoort "
"normalerwies nich. Denn mag dat goot wesen, wenn Du disse Optschoon bruukst "
"un de Opgaven un Programmen, de de Brukers so un so nich bruken köönt, ut de "
"Menüs wegmaakst."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:9
msgid "Disable access to a command shell"
msgstr "Togriep op de Konsool utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:10
msgid ""
"In an environment where the desktop is dedicated to a defined set of tasks "
"it may be desirable to disable access to a command shell to prevent users "
"from engaging in tasks that were not intended or authorized; hence, it is "
"strongly recommended to disable access to a command shell if the desktop is "
"to act as a public terminal."
msgstr ""
"In en Ümgeven, binnen de de Schriefdisch bloots för en fast Sett vun Opgaven "
"inricht is, mag dat goot wesen, wenn Du den Togriep op de Konsool utmaakst, "
"denn köönt keen Brukers Saken doon, de se nich schöölt oder wo se keen "
"Verlöven för hebbt. Lieksterwelt is dat redig anraadt, dat Du den Togriep op "
"de Konsool utmaakst, wenn Du den Reekner as en apen Terminal bruken wullt."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:11
msgid "Disable Logout option"
msgstr "Afmellen utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:12
msgid ""
"This prevents the user from logging out. To make this option effective it is "
"important to ensure that key-combinations to terminate the X-server, such as "
"Alt-Ctrl-Backspace, are disabled in the configuration of the X-server."
msgstr ""
"Dit verhöödt, dat de Bruker sik afmellen deit. Wullt Du, dat disse Optschoon "
"funkscheneert, muttst Du besekern, all Tastkombinatschonen för't Utmaken vun "
"den X-Server (as Strg+Alt+Torüchtast) sünd binnen den X-Server sien "
"Instellen utmaakt."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:13
msgid "Disable Lock Screen option"
msgstr "Afsluten vun den Schirm utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:14
msgid ""
"When the desktop is to act as a public terminal or is to be shared by "
"different users it may be desirable to prevent locking of the screen to "
"ensure that the system remains accessible if a user leaves the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Wullt Du den Reekner as apen Terminal inrichten oder schall mehr as een "
"Bruker em bruken, mag dat goot wesen, Du maakst dat Afsluten vun den Schirm "
"ut. Denn blifft de Reekner ok denn bruukbor, wenn en Bruker dat Terminal "
"stahn lett."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:15
msgid "Disable \"Run Command\" option (Alt-F2)"
msgstr "\"Befehl utföhren\"-Dialoog (Alt+F2) utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:16
msgid ""
"The \"Run Command\" option can normally be used to execute arbitrary "
"commands; however, when access to a command shell is restricted only "
"applications and services defined by a .desktop file can be started this "
"way. Disabling \"Run Command\" here hides the option completely."
msgstr ""
"De Dialoog \"Befehl utföhren\" lett sik normalerwies för't Utföhren vun all "
"un een Befehl bruken; man wenn de Togriep op de Konsool ingrenzt is, laat "
"sik bloots Programmen un Deensten opropen, de en .desktop-Datei hebbt. Hier "
"kannst Du den Dialoog heel utmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:17
msgid "Disable toolbar moving"
msgstr "Verschuven vun Warktüüchbalkens utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:18
msgid ""
"Normally toolbars in applications can be moved around; when this option is "
"chosen all toolbars are fixed in their original positions."
msgstr ""
"Normalerwies laat sik Warktüüchbalkens binnen Programmen bewegen. Is disse "
"Optschoon anmaakt, sünd all Warktüüchbalkens an ehr Orginaalsteden fastsett."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:19
msgid "Disable execution of arbitrary .desktop files"
msgstr "Utföhren vun egenklook utsöcht .desktop-Dateien utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:20
msgid ""
"This option defines whether users may execute .desktop files that are not "
"part of the system-wide desktop icons, KDE menu, registered services or "
"autostart services. When access to a command shell is restricted it is "
"recommended to to disable the execution of arbitrary .desktop files as well "
"since such .desktop files can be used to circumvent the command shell "
"restriction."
msgstr ""
"Disse Optschoon leggt fast, wat Brukers .desktop-Dateien utföhren dörvt, de "
"nich Deel sünd vun de normalen Schriefdisch-Lüttbiller, dat KDE-Menü, vun "
"inmeldt oder Sülvststart-Deensten. Is de Togriep op de Konsool ingrenzt, is "
"dat anraadt, Du maakst ok dat Utföhren un egenköppsch utsöcht .desktop-"
"Dateien ut - dor lett sik de Konsool-Ingrenzen mit torüchdreihen."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:21
msgid "Disable starting of a second X session"
msgstr "Starten vun en tweet X-Törn utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:22
msgid ""
"KDM has the possibility to login a second user in parallel to the current "
"session. Note that this can also be configured as part of the KDM settings "
"in which case the setting here should be left enabled."
msgstr ""
"Bi KDM kann Een sik as tweet Bruker blang den aktuellen Törn anmellen. Du "
"kannst dat ok binnen de KDM-Instellen ännern, man denn laat disse Optschoon "
"anmaakt."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:23
msgid "Disable input line history"
msgstr "Ingaavreeg-Vörgeschicht utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:24
msgid ""
"If a single account is used by multiple people it may be desirable to "
"disable the input line history out of privacy considerations."
msgstr ""
"Bruukt mehr Brukers Is een enkel Ko, mag dat goot wesen, Du maakst de "
"Ingaavreeg-Vörgeschicht ut. Dat schuult de Brukers ehr Privaatrebeet.to "

#: kiosk_data.cpp:25
msgid "Enforce DRM restrictions"
msgstr "DVP-Ingrenzen verdwingen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:26
msgid ""
"Some KDE applications can enforce DRM restrictions on content. You may want "
"to enable this if your organisation relies on such restrictions or if local "
"law requires it."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg KDE-Programmen köönt Ingrenzen ut de Digitaal Verlööfnis-Pleeg "
"(engl. »Digital Rights Management«, kort »DRM«) verdwingen. Maak dit an, wenn "
"Dien Organisatschoon vun disse Ingrenzen afhangt oder dat Recht in Dien Land "
"dat verlangen deit."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:27
msgid "Prevent Downloading"
msgstr "Daalladen verhöden"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:28
msgid ""
"Some KDE applications can prevent the user from downloading or uploading "
"files. The normal web browsing experience will not be affected. Note that "
"you still have to set up the unix file permissions correctly - treat this as "
"merely cosmetic for security."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg KDE-Programmen köönt dat verhöden, dat Brukers Dateien daal- oder "
"hoochlaadt. Nettkieken is liekers normaal mööglich. Man beacht: Du muttst de "
"UNIX-Dateiverlöven liekers akraat setten - dit hier is man bloots kosmeetsch "
"för de Sekerheit."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:29
msgid "Desktop Icons"
msgstr "Schriefdischlüttbiller"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:30
msgid "Desktop Icons are provided by \"kdesktop\"."
msgstr "Schriefdischlüttbiller warrt vun \"kdesktop\" praatstellt."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:31
msgid "Lock down Desktop Settings"
msgstr "Schriefdisch-Instellen fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:32
msgid ""
"When the desktop settings are locked down the user can no longer change how "
"the desktop behaves or look like. This does not affect the ability to add "
"new files or shortcuts to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Sünd de Instellen vun den Schriefdisch fastsett, köönt Brukers nich mehr "
"topassen, wodennig he utsüht oder sik bedregen deit. Lüttbiller un Dateien "
"laat sik ok wieder tofögen."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:33
msgid "Disable context menus"
msgstr "Rechtsklickmenüs utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:34
msgid ""
"When checked the user will no longer get any context menu. Normally the user "
"can get a context menu by clicking with the right mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, köönt de Brukers keen Rechtklickmenüs opropen. Normalerwies "
"köönt se dat mit den rechten Muusknoop."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:35
msgid "Lock down all Desktop icons"
msgstr "All Schriefdisch-Lüttbiller fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:36
msgid ""
"When checked the user will not be able to remove or edit any existing icon "
"or file on the Desktop or add any new icon or file."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, köönt Brukers keen vörhannen Lüttbiller oder Dateien op den "
"Schriefdisch bewerken oder wegmaken, un ok keen nieg Lüttbiller oder Dateien "
"tofögen."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:37
msgid "Lock down system wide Desktop icons"
msgstr "Systeem-Schriefdischlüttbiller fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:38
msgid ""
"When checked the user will not be able to remove or edit any of the system "
"wide icons but will still be able to add, remove or edit personal icons or "
"files on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, köönt Brukers keen Systeem-Lüttbiller bewerken oder "
"wegmaken, man köönt egen Lüttbiller un Dateien ok wieder tofögen, bewerken "
"un wegmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:39
msgid "Add additional vendor specific icons"
msgstr "Bito Maker-Lüttbiller tofögen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:40
msgid ""
"When this option is checked users will get additional icons copied to their "
"Desktop when they first log in. These icons do not appear in the preview."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, hebbt Brukers bi't eerste Anmellen noch anner Lüttbiller op "
"ehr Schriefdischen. Disse Lüttbiller dukt in de Vöransicht nich op."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:41
msgid "Desktop Background"
msgstr "Schriefdisch-Achtergrund"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:42
msgid "Set up the Desktop Background also known as Wallpaper."
msgstr "Den Schriefdisch Achtergrund, ok Achtergrundbild nöömt, inrichten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:43
msgid "Lock down Desktop Background Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för den Schriefdisch-Achtergrund fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:44
msgid ""
"When the desktop background settings are locked down the user can no longer "
"change them."
msgstr ""
"Sünd de Achtergrundinstellen vun den Schriefdisch fastsett, köönt Brukers se "
"nich mehr ännern."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:45
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Pausschirm"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:46
msgid "Set up Screen Saver"
msgstr "Pausschirm instellen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:47
msgid "Lock down Screen Saver Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för den Pausschirm fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:48
msgid ""
"When the Screen Saver settings are locked down the user can no longer change "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Sünd de Pausschirminstellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:49
msgid "Disable OpenGL-based Screen Savers"
msgstr "OpenGL-Pausschirmen utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:50
msgid ""
"OpenGL-based screen savers may cause problems on systems without decent "
"OpenGL support; with this option all such screensavers can be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Pausschirmen, de OpenGL bruukt, köönt op Reekners, de keen dannig OpenGL-"
"Ünnerstütten hebbt, to Problemen föhren. Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du all "
"disse Pausschirmen utmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:51
msgid "Discreet Screen Savers Only"
msgstr "Bloots schulen Pausschirmen bruken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Some screensavers do not hide the complete screen content and may leave "
"possible sensitive information visible. This option disables all such "
"screensavers and only enables those screensavers that completely hide the "
"original content of the screen."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg Pausschirmen versteekt nich den helen Schirminholt, se laat Saken "
"sichtbor, de villicht schuulsam sünd. Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du all "
"disse Pausschirmen ut- un bloots de anmaken, de den Schirm sien "
"Orginaalinholt heel un deel versteken doot."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:53
msgid "KDE Menu"
msgstr "KDE-Menü"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:54
msgid "The KDE Application menu"
msgstr "Dat KDE-Programmmenü"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:56
msgid ""
"This option disables all menu items that require root access and that will "
"ask the user for the root password."
msgstr ""
"Disse Optschoon maakt all Menüindrääg ut, de Systeemplegerverlöven bruukt un "
"den Bruker na den Systeempleger sien Passwoort fraagt."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:57
msgid "Disable menu editing"
msgstr "Menübewerken utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:58
msgid ""
"This disables the menu-option to edit the KDE Application Menu. When "
"disabled, users will no longer be able to make changes to their personal "
"application menu."
msgstr ""
"Dit maakt de Menüoptschoon ut, mit de sik dat KDE-Menü bewerken lett. Is dat "
"utmaakt, köönt Brukers ehr egen Programmmenü nich mehr topassen."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:59
msgid "Theming"
msgstr "Mustern"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:60
msgid "Set up of Fonts, Colors and Style"
msgstr "Schriftoorden, Klören un Stil fastleggen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:61
msgid "Lock down Style Settings"
msgstr "Stil-Instellen fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:62
msgid ""
"When the Style settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Stil-Instellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:63
msgid "Lock down Color Settings"
msgstr "Klöörinstellen fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:64
msgid ""
"When the Color settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Klöörinstellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:65
msgid "Lock down Font Settings"
msgstr "Schriftoort-Instellen fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:66
msgid ""
"When the Font settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr ""
"Sünd de Schriftoort-Instellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:67
msgid "Lock down Window Decoration Settings"
msgstr "Finsterdekoratschoon-Instellen fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:68
msgid ""
"When the Window Decoration settings are locked down the user can no longer "
"change them."
msgstr ""
"Sünd de Instellen för de Finsterdekoratschoon fastsett, köönt Brukers se "
"nich mehr ännern."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:69
msgid "Panel"
msgstr "Paneel"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:70
msgid "The KDE panel \"kicker\" is normally found at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "Normalerwies is dat KDE-Paneel \"kicker\" nerrn op den Schirm"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:71
msgid "Lock down panel"
msgstr "Paneel fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:72
msgid ""
"This option can be used to lock down the panel. The user will then no longer "
"be able to add, remove or change any of the permanent panel items."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du dat Paneel fastsetten, Brukers köönt denn keen "
"duerhaftig Paneelelementen mehr tofögen, ännern oder wegmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:73
msgid "Disable Context Menus"
msgstr "Rechtsklickmenüs utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:74
msgid ""
"This option disables the context menus that one normally gets when pressing "
"the right mouse button in the panel."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de Rechtsklickmenüs utmaken, de Een "
"normalerwies mit den rechten Muusknoop in't Paneel opropen kann."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:75
msgid "Network Proxy"
msgstr "Nettwark-Proxy"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:76
msgid "Set up of Network Proxy settings"
msgstr "Instellen för den Nettwark-Proxy"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:77
msgid "Lock down Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Proxy-Instellen fastsetten"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:78
msgid ""
"When the Proxy settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Proxy-Instellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:79
msgid "Konqueror"
msgstr "Konqueror"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:80
msgid "Konqueror is a combined web- and filebrowser."
msgstr "Konqueror is Nettkieker un Dateipleger in een Programm."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:81
msgid "Disable Properties in context menu"
msgstr "\"Egenschappen\" binnen Rechtsklickmenü utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:82
msgid ""
"This option can be used to disable the <i>Properties</i> option in the "
"context menu for files."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de Optschoon <i>Egenschappen</i> binnen dat "
"Rechtsklickmenü vun Dateien utmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:83
msgid "Disable Open With action"
msgstr "\"Opmaken mit\" utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:84
msgid "This option can be used to disable the <i>Open With</i> menu option."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de <i>Opmaken mit</i>-Menüoptschoon utmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:85
msgid "Disable Open In New Tab action"
msgstr "\"In'n nieg Paneel opmaken\" utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:86
msgid ""
"This option can be used to disable the <i>Open In New Tab</i> menu option."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de <i>In'n nieg Paneel opmaken</i>-"
"Menüoptschoon utmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:87
msgid "Disable file-browsing outside home directory"
msgstr "Keen Dateien buten den Tohuusorner ankieken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:88
msgid ""
"This option can be used to prevent the user from browsing the file system "
"outside his or her own home directory."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du verhöden, dat Brukers sik Dateien buten ehr "
"egen Tohuusornern ankiekt."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:89
msgid "Menu Actions"
msgstr "Menü-Akschonen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:90
msgid "Common menu actions found in applications."
msgstr "Allmeen Menüakschonen binnen Programmen"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:91 kiosk_data.cpp:93 kiosk_data.cpp:95 kiosk_data.cpp:97
#: kiosk_data.cpp:99 kiosk_data.cpp:101 kiosk_data.cpp:103 kiosk_data.cpp:105
#: kiosk_data.cpp:107 kiosk_data.cpp:109 kiosk_data.cpp:111
#, c-format
msgid "Disable File -> %action"
msgstr "\"Datei -> %action\" utmaken"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:92 kiosk_data.cpp:96 kiosk_data.cpp:98 kiosk_data.cpp:100
#: kiosk_data.cpp:102 kiosk_data.cpp:104 kiosk_data.cpp:108 kiosk_data.cpp:110
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This option can be used to remove the <i>File -> %action</i> menu-option "
"from all applications."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de Optschoon <i>%action</i> ut all <i>Datei</"
"i>-Menüs wegmaken."

#: kiosk_data.cpp:94
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This option can be used to remove the <i>File -> %action</i> menu-option "
"from all applications. See also <i>Open Recent</i>"
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de Optschoon <i>%action</i> ut all <i>Datei</"
"i>-Menüs wegmaken. Kiek ok bi <i>Verleden opmaken</i>"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:106
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This option can be used to remove the <i>File -> %action</i> menu-option "
"from all applications. See also <i>Print Preview</i>"
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de Optschoon <i>%action</i> ut all <i>Datei</"
"i>-Menüs wegmaken. Kiek ok bi <i>Druckvöransicht</i>"

#: kiosk_data.cpp:112
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This option can be used to remove the <i>File -> %action</i> menu-option "
"from all applications. This option has been added for completeness. Usually "
"the application can be terminated via the window manager as well."
